paperweight-wallpapers (0.3.3-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * postinst: on fresh install, copy 91-wallpaper.conf, 92-wallpaper-picker.conf,
    and paperweight-wallpaper to the invoking user's home ($SUDO_USER, with
    UID 1000 fallback). Uses cp -n so existing customizations are not clobbered.
    Same pattern as paperweight-skel.

 -- Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>  Mon, 16 Jun 2026 00:00:04 +0000

paperweight-wallpapers (0.3.2-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Convert wallpaper picker to yad: paperweight-wallpaper now uses
    yad --list with IMG thumbnail column (Preview/Name/Path columns,
    scanning system wallpapers dir and ~/Pictures/). Wofi dmenu fallback
    retained. Replaces zenity dep with yad; script upgraded to bash for
    array support.

 -- Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>  Tue, 16 Jun 2026 00:00:03 +0000

paperweight-wallpapers (0.3.1-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Replace waypaper with a zenity+wofi wallpaper picker: paperweight-wallpaper
    now uses zenity --file-selection (GTK file chooser with image thumbnails)
    with a wofi dmenu fallback. Drops waypaper dep (not in Trixie); adds zenity
    and swaybg to Depends.

 -- Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>  Tue, 16 Jun 2026 00:00:02 +0000

paperweight-wallpapers (0.3.0-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Add paperweight-wallpaper: waypaper wrapper that saves chosen wallpaper
    to the active theme's config (~/.config/paperweight-os/wallpapers/<theme>)
    so each theme remembers its own wallpaper independently.
  * Add 92-wallpaper-picker.conf: binds $mod+w to paperweight-wallpaper.
  * Update 91-wallpaper.conf: per-theme override > artwork default > solid
    color fallback chain on session start and sway reload.
  * Add waypaper to Depends.

 -- Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>  Tue, 16 Jun 2026 00:00:01 +0000

