paperweight-wallpapers (0.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Initial release. Solid-color wallpapers for Catppuccin Latte, Frappé,
    Macchiato, and Mocha. Includes 91-wallpaper.conf skel fragment to apply
    the active theme's wallpaper on session start and sway reload.

